From 81a1860c8c145818a74210d0f6654932dfd8c051 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JD Lien <jd@jdlien.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:41:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] ak820pro (dev): play times as a new frame type, per
 codex's play-times review -- type 1 back to its frozen form (P2 1); type 3,
 transport, exactly [icon][state][pos][dur]: the shown slot's icon
 (display_set_text_icon, a no-op with nothing shown) and the playback readout,
 so a play/pause or a seek needs no title and an older board rejects it whole
 and keeps its text; the readout from a base and elapsed time, so Fn+D or an
 animation no longer puts it behind (P2 5); a media key's optimistic freeze
 ends after 15 s on its own, as if unpressed (P2 6) (10-20)

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01L1gxigSPSsSyFgBh2Y6cme
